    "description": "Built and maintained a React-based frontend for a comprehensive theatrical rights and licensing management platform:\n\nArchitected high-performance UI components for complex licensing workflows with real-time form autosave, debounced search modals, and infinite scroll implementations\n\nDeveloped sophisticated financial operations interfaces, including accounting systems, invoice management, and multi-division licensing across US/UK territories\n\nImplemented dependency-light state management using Jotai with advanced async workflows and React Query for optimized API caching strategies\n\nBuilt pixel-perfect dynamic forms and data tables with comprehensive schema validation using Zod and React Hook Form for licensing applications and venue management\n\nEngineered multi-tenant architecture frontend supporting division-based data segregation with role-based permission rendering and granular access controls.\n\nCollaborated with the Laravel backend team to integrate complex business logic, including royalty management, content catalogs, and automated approval workflows",
