    "description": "Led development of enterprise-grade omnichannel communication platform using both React and Angular, serving high-volume customer interactions across multiple channels:\n\nMulti-Platform Architecture: Built a React-based real-time messaging hub consolidating SMS, LiveChat, Facebook, and Google Business messaging into a unified interface with normalized Redux state management and RxJS observables.\n\nAdvanced State Management: Architected Angular application with NgRx for complex workflows and React components with Redux patterns, handling real-time data synchronization across 20+ feature modules with optimized lazy loading\n\nReal-time Communication Systems: Implemented sophisticated Socket.IO integration with WebSocket management, reactive programming patterns using RxJS, and event-driven architecture supporting multi-room messaging with automatic reconnection\n\nInteractive UI Development: Built drag-drop visual bot builder (Angular/jsPlumb), infinite scroll messaging interfaces (React), and performance-optimized rendering using Intersection Observer and virtual scrolling techniques\n\nEnterprise Integrations: Integrated multiple CRM systems (Salesforce, HubSpot, Microsoft Dynamics) and payment processors (Authorize.Net, Braintree) with comprehensive error handling and PCI-compliant workflows\n\nData Visualization & Analytics: Developed D3.js dashboards for cross-platform analytics, performance metrics, and business intelligence reporting with interactive charts and export capabilities\n\nPerformance Optimization: Achieved 40% bundle size reduction through strategic code splitting, OnPush change detection, and memory management with proper cleanup of subscriptions and event listeners",
